  "job_B1.4.19_20251001_193233": {
    "text": "Seo halige Cristes boc \u00fee ymbe Cristes wundra spryc\u00f0 seg\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a Sunderhalgan on sumne s\u00e6l ahsodan\nAnd swa swa gefyrn gelamp on Noeys flode, menn \u00e6ton and druncon and dwollice leofodan, cnihtas\n\u00de\u00e6t flod \u00fea becom f\u00e6rlice ofer hi ealle, and eall mancynn adrencte, buton eahta mannum, \u00fee innan \u00feam\nAnd swa swa on Lo\u00f0es dagum eft sy\u00f0\u00f0an gelamp, menn \u00e6ton and druncon, bohtan and sealdan,\nEall swa bi\u00f0 on \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fee ure Drihten bi\u00f0 \u00e6teowed, and he cym\u00f0 to demenne on \u00feam micclan dome\nGif hwa bi\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re tide ymbe hys tilunge, o\u00f0\u00f0e on his huse, o\u00f0\u00f0e on hys \u00e6cere, ne m\u00e6g he geefstan\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re nihte beo\u00f0 twegen on anum bedde; an \u00fe\u00e6ra bi\u00f0 genumen, and o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten.\nAnd twa grinda\u00f0 \u00feonne on anre cwyrne \u00e6tg\u00e6dere; seo an bi\u00f0 genumen, and seo o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten.\nTwegen beo\u00f0 on \u00e6cere erigende \u00e6tg\u00e6dere; se an bi\u00f0 genumen, and se o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten.\nHi andwyrdan \u00fea and hyne ahsodan \u00feuss: Hwider beo\u00f0 hy genumene?\nAnd he hym cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Swa hw\u00e6r swa \u00fe\u00e6t hold bi\u00f0, \u00feider gadria\u00f0 \u00fea earnas.\nWe willa\u00f0 eow nu secgan sceortlice, gif we magon, \u00fea diglostan word on \u00feisum Drihtenlican godspelle,\nWe habba\u00f0 nu gehyred on \u00feisum halgan godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t we ne magon na cepan, ne nanum menn nis cu\u00f0,\n\u00dea earman synfullan, \u00fee hyne forsawan on life, and mid yfelum d\u00e6dum hyne \u00e6fre gremodan, \u00fea beo\u00f0\nSe H\u00e6lend us s\u00e6de so\u00f0lice gelicnysse be Noeys flode and Lo\u00f0es alysednysse; nu wite ge sume hu hit\nLo\u00f0 w\u00e6s iu gehaten sum halig Godes \u00feegn, Abrahames bro\u00f0or sunu, \u00e6r Moyses \u00e6; se eardode \u00fea on\n\u00dea forb\u00e6rnde hi God mid heora fif burhscirum mid heofonlicum fyre and hellicum swefle; ac he sende\nEall swa bi\u00f0 on Domesd\u00e6ge on ures Drihtnes tocyme: \u00fe\u00e6t fyr cym\u00f0 swa f\u00e6rlice \u00fe\u00e6t menn\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re nihte beo\u00f0 twegen on anum bedde; an \u00feara bi\u00f0 genumen, and o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten.\nNiht is her gecweden for \u00f0\u00e6re nytennysse, and for \u00fe\u00e6re mycelan ehtnysse on Anticristes timan; \u00feonne\n\u00d0a beo\u00f0 \u00feonne on bedde \u00fee beo\u00f0 on stillnysse, and fram eallum woruldcarum \u00e6mtige \u00feonne beo\u00f0, and\nO\u00fere beo\u00f0 gecorene and Gode gecweme, o\u00f0re beo\u00f0 mid hiwunge on his \u00feeowdome afundene.\n\u00deonne genim\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend to hys heofonlican rice \u00fea \u00fee \u00e6mtige w\u00e6ron fram eallum woruldcarum, \u00e6fre\nSwa bi\u00f0 se an genumen and se o\u00f0er forl\u00e6ten \u00fee on \u00feam bedde beo\u00f0 \u00feonne gemette \u00fe\u00e6t is, on \u00fe\u00e6re\nTwa grinda\u00f0 \u00feonne on anre cwyrne \u00e6tg\u00e6dere; seo an bi\u00f0 genumen, and seo o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten.\n\u00c6r he cw\u00e6\u00f0 twegen, nu he cw\u00e6\u00f0 twa, on anre cwyrne emlice grindende.\n\u00de\u00e6t synd \u00fea woruldmenn \u00fee woruld\u00feing bega\u00f0; and seo woruldcaru is \u00fe\u00e6re cwyrne wi\u00f0meten, \u00fee \u00e6fre\nBe \u00feysum he cw\u00e6\u00f0 twa, and nolde cwe\u00f0an twegen, for \u00feam \u00fee hi so\u00f0lice ne beo\u00f0 on swylcere\nFor\u00f0i synd twa gecwedene, and na twegen weras, for \u00feam woruldcarum \u00fee hi on wunia\u00f0.\nOf \u00feam woruldmannum witodlice beo\u00f0 on twa wisan gemodode and mislice gelogode; sume beo\u00f0\nTwegen beo\u00f0 on \u00e6cere, erigende \u00e6tg\u00e6dere; se an bi\u00f0 genumen, and se o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten.\nHer he cw\u00e6\u00f0 twegen, and nolde cwe\u00fean twa, for \u00fe\u00e6re fullfremednysse and f\u00e6gerum ge\u00feing\u00feum \u00fee \u00fea\nGodes \u00e6cer is Godes gela\u00feung, \u00fe\u00e6t is, eall Cristen folc \u00fee on Crist gelyf\u00f0, swa swa Paulus cw\u00e6\u00f0 on\nWita\u00f0 nu \u00feis: Biscopas and m\u00e6ssepreostas syndon manna lareowas; hi sceolan hogian ymbe \u00fe\u00e6s\nHi sceolon \u00feone Cristendom don Cristes folce, and mid heora lare symle to geleafan weman, and \u00e6fre\nIs swa\u00feeah to lyt \u00fe\u00e6ra lareowa nu \u00fee \u00feus don wille, and is manncynn for\u00fei miclum geyrmed, for \u00feam\n\u00deis cw\u00e6\u00f0 se witega be Godes lareowum, \u00fee noldan bodian and gebigan manncynn to Godes willan \u00fea\nNu is hit gyt wyrse on urum timan, \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle suwia\u00f0, and unriht g\u00e6\u00f0 for\u00f0 openlice and digollice,\nWitodlice \u00fea lareowas \u00fee us lar of com, hi bododan \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enum and \u00feam hetelum ehterum, and\nNu synd twegen gecwedene \u00fee Gode tilian sceolan on \u00fe\u00e6re gastlican tilunge on Godes gela\u00f0unge, for\nSume hi beo\u00f0 geornfulle, sume gymelease, sume anr\u00e6de, sume asolcene, sume nyttwyr\u00f0e, sume\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 se an genumen, and se o\u00f0or forl\u00e6ten, \u00feonne se H\u00e6lend genim\u00f0 to his halgum englum \u00f0a\nOn \u00feisum \u00ferim endebyrdnyssum bi\u00f0 eall mancynn belocen: twegen on \u00feam bedde, and twa \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re\nHi andwyrdan \u00fea and hyne ahsodon \u00feuss: Hwider beo\u00f0 hi genumene?\nAnd he hym cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Swa hw\u00e6r swa \u00fe\u00e6t hold bi\u00f0, \u00feider gaderia\u00f0 \u00fea earnas.\n\u00dea Sundorhalgan ahsodan \u00feone H\u00e6lend \u00fea \u00feus: hwider \u00fea goodan sceoldan gegripene beon, o\u00f0\u00f0e\n\u00d0a andwyrde he be \u00feam goodum, and nolde be \u00feam yfelum.\n\u00dea earnas getacnia\u00f0 \u00fea ge\u00feungenan halgan; and swa swa earnas hi gegaderia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t hold bi\u00f0,\n\u00dea \u00fee beo\u00f0 forl\u00e6tene and belocene wi\u00f0utan of \u00feam \u00ferim werodum, \u00fea gewenda\u00f0 to helle, mid eallum\nWe habba\u00f0 nu ges\u00e6d hu \u00f0a Sundorhalgan ahsodon \u00feone H\u00e6lend be ende \u00feissere worulde; nu wille we\n\u00d0a \u00fee on Iudea lande \u00feonne lybbende beo\u00f0, \u00fea fleo\u00f0 \u00feonne to muntum and to micclum dunum; and se\nAnd se \u00fee on \u00e6cere beo ymbe hys tilunge, ne cyrre he underb\u00e6c to genimenne hys reaf.\nWa \u00feam eacniendum on \u00feam yfelum dagum, and \u00feam fedendum on \u00fe\u00e6re frecednysse.\nBidda\u00f0 eornostlice \u00fe\u00e6t hyt ne beo on wintra, o\u00f0\u00f0e on restend\u00e6ge, \u00feonne ge \u00e6mtige beo\u00f0.\n\u00deonne beo\u00f0 witodlice swylce gedrefednyssa swylce n\u00e6fre \u00e6r n\u00e6ran, ne eft ne gewur\u00fea\u00f0.\nButan God gescyrte \u00fea sorhfullan dagas, eall manncynn forwurde witodlice \u00e6tg\u00e6dere.\nAc for hys gecorenum he gescyrte \u00fea dagas.\nGif hwa \u00feonne eow s\u00e6g\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylf beo \u00feonne on worulde wuniende mid mannum, ne gelyfe ge\nWarnia\u00f0 eow eornostlice; ic hyt h\u00e6bbe eow ges\u00e6d.\nSona \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re gedrefednysse adeorca\u00f0 seo sunne, and mid ealle a\u00feeostra\u00f0, and eac se mona, and\nMenn geseo\u00f0 \u00feonne mannes Sunu cumende on \u00feam healicum wolcnum mid micclum wuldre; he asent\nWe habba\u00f0 nu ges\u00e6d \u00feis halige godspell anfealdum andgyte, and we eac willa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t gastlice andgyt\n\u00dea halgan apostolas \u00fee mid \u00feam H\u00e6lende ferdon, \u00fea \u00fea he her on worulde wunode mid mannum,\nIu on ealdum dagum, \u00e6r \u00f0am \u00fee Cristendom w\u00e6re, menn worhton deofolgyld wide geond \u00feas woruld,\nNu ne wyrc\u00f0 nan mann nu on \u00feysum timan, gif he geleafan h\u00e6f\u00f0, h\u00e6\u00feengyld openlice; ac se arleasa\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 mare deofolgyld \u00feonne se deofollica Antecrist hym Godes wur\u00f0mynt geahnige, and hyne\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re halgan stowe stent \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t deofolgyld, swa swa se apostol awrat on sumum hys pistole: Ita\nHim fara\u00f0 mid \u00e6fre ungesewenlice deoflu, \u00feurh \u00f0a he wyrc\u00f0 wundra wide geond \u00feas eor\u00f0an, and ofer\n\u00dea \u00f0e on Iudea lande \u00feonne libbende beo\u00f0, \u00fea fleo\u00f0 to muntum and to micclum dunum; and se \u00f0e on\nAnd se \u00f0e on \u00e6cere beo ymbe hys tilunge, ne cyrre he underb\u00e6c to genimene hys reaf.\nWe moton eow secgan swa swa ge magon understandan, hwilum anfealdlice be eowrum andgite,\nWa \u00feam eacniendum on \u00feam yfelum dagum, and \u00feam fedendum on \u00fe\u00e6re frecednysse.\nHw\u00e6t agylta\u00f0 \u00fea wif, \u00fee be Godes h\u00e6se tyma\u00f0 and heora cild feda\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re frecednysse?\nAc \u00feis is gecweden be \u00feam leasum Cristenum, \u00fee beo\u00f0 mid leahtrum afyllede, swa swa gefearhsugu,\nBidda\u00f0 eornostlice \u00fe\u00e6t hyt ne beo on wintra, o\u00f0\u00f0e on restend\u00e6ge, \u00feonne ge \u00e6mtige beo\u00f0.\nNe m\u00e6nde he \u00feone winter \u00fee gewunelice cym\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6s geares ymbryne, ac swa swa he on o\u00f0re stowe\nSe restend\u00e6g is, swa swa we r\u00e6da\u00f0 on bocum, halig freolsd\u00e6g on Iudea folce, swa swa we healda\u00f0\n\u00deonne beo\u00f0 witodlice swylce gedrefednyssa swylce n\u00e6fre \u00e6r n\u00e6ron, ne eft ne gewur\u00f0a\u00f0.\nMicel ehtnys w\u00e6s on anginne Cristendomes, and eac lange sy\u00f0\u00f0an for Cristes geleafan, \u00e6r \u00f0am \u00fee\nMan acwealde \u00fea Cristenan mid mislicum cwylmingum, and mid menigfealdum tintregum hi\nNu ne bi\u00f0 hit na swa on Antecristes timan; he tintrega\u00f0 \u00fea halgan, and eac tacna wyrc\u00f0, and \u00fea halgan\n\u00deonne wet se deofol, and gewitna\u00f0 \u00fea halgan mid swylcum tintregum swa we secgan ne magon, and\nButan God gescyrtte \u00fea sorhfullan dagas, eall manncynn forwurde witodlice \u00e6tg\u00e6dere; ac for his\n\u00d0reo gear he ricsa\u00f0 and syx mon\u00f0as on mancynne, on eallre modignysse, eall mid deofle afylled, and\nAc for Godes gecorenum God gehrada\u00f0 hys timan.\nGif hwa \u00feonne eow seg\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylf beo \u00feonne wunigende on weorolde mid mannum, ne gelyfe ge\nUre H\u00e6lend Crist ne cym\u00f0 na to mancynne openlice \u00e6teowed on \u00feissere weorolde \u00e6r \u00feam micclan\nHe gewarnode \u00fea, swa swa \u00feis gewrit us seg\u00f0, hys halgan apostolas, and eac us \u00feurh hi, \u00fe\u00e6t we\nSona \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re gedrefednysse adeorca\u00f0 seo sunne, and mid ealle a\u00feeostra\u00f0, and eac se mona, and\nSona \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re ehtnysse bi\u00f0 Antecrist ofslagen \u00feurh Cristes mihte on hys tocyme, and engla werodu\nMenn geseo\u00f0 \u00feonne mannes Sunu cumende on \u00feam healicum wolcnum mid micclum wuldre.\nCrist sylf is mannes Sunu, swa swa he s\u00e6de foroft; he is anes mannes sunu swa swa nan o\u00f0er man nis;\nHe asent \u00feonne so\u00f0lice hys englas, and hi gegaderia\u00f0 Godes gecorenan menn fram \u00feam feower\n\u00d0a englas \u00feonne blawa\u00f0 heora byman hlude, and eall manncyn arist \u00fee \u00e6fre cucu w\u00e6s of heora\nCrist cw\u00e6\u00f0 on o\u00f0re stowe be \u00feam arleasum \u00feuss: Exibunt angeli et separabunt malos de medio\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea halgan si\u00f0ia\u00f0 mid Criste to heofonan rice mid hys halgum englum, ge weras ge wifmenn,",
